---
import { Card, CardTitle } from "../components/card";
import "../styles/global.css";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" />
    <meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
    <title>Astro Basics</title>
  </head>
  <body class="bg-dark-bg text-dark-text-primary px-8 py-8 font-mono md:px-72">
    <header class="mb-8 grid grid-cols-12 gap-4">
      <Card className="col-span-10">
        <CardTitle>
          <h1>Navigation</h1>
        </CardTitle>
      </Card>
      <Card className="col-span-2" />
    </header>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4">
      <aside class="col-span-3 flex flex-col gap-8 md:col-span-1">
        <Card>
          <CardTitle>
            <h1>About Me</h1>
          </CardTitle>

          <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
            <pre
              aria-hidden="true"
              class="text-dark-text-primary inline-block text-left text-xs leading-none whitespace-pre">
██╗  ██╗███████╗████████╗███████╗██╗      █████╗
██║ ██╔╝██╔════╝╚══██╔══╝██╔════╝██║     ██╔══██╗
█████╔╝ █████╗     ██║   █████╗  ██║     ███████║
██╔═██╗ ██╔══╝     ██║   ██╔══╝  ██║     ██╔══██║
██║  ██╗███████╗   ██║   ███████╗███████╗██║  ██║
╚═╝  ╚═╝╚══════╝   ╚═╝   ╚══════╝╚══════╝╚═╝  ╚═╝
            </pre>

            <p class="text-dark-text-secondary">Hi! Welcome to my blog.</p>
          </div>
        </Card>

        <Card>
          <CardTitle>
            <h1>Free Space</h1>
          </CardTitle>
        </Card>
      </aside>

      <main class="col-span-3 flex flex-col gap-8 md:col-span-2">
        <slot />
      </main>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
